ate Medium, NIH Thioglycollate Broth, TG Broth\nL28: \nL29: 【5†Sign In】 to View Organizational & Contract Pricing.\nL30: \nL31: ### Select a Size\nL32: \nL33: Change View\nL34: \nL35: * * *\nL36: ### About This Item\nL37: \nL38: NACRES:\nL39: \nL40: NA.74\nL41: \nL42: UNSPSC Code:\nL43: \nL44: 41171607\nL45: \nL46: Manufacturer/tradename:\nL47: \nL48: NutriSelect^{®} Plus\nL49: \nL50: Agency:\nL51: \nL52: IP, according to USP\nL53: \nL54: Form:\nL55: \nL56: powder\nL57: \nL58: Suitability:\nL59: anaerobic bacteria, bacteria (microaerophilic), nonselective for Aspergillus spp., nonselective for Bacillus spp., nonselective for Bacteroides spp., nonselective for Candida spp., nonselective for Clostridium spp., nonselective for Escherichia coli, nonselective for Pseudomonas spp., nonselective for Staphylococcus spp., nonselective for coliforms\nL60: \nL61: Application(s):\nL62: \nL63: food and beverages\nL64: sterility testing, microbiology\nL65: \nL66: Technical Service\nL67: \nL68: Need help? Our team of experienced scientists is here for you.\nL69: 【6†Let Us Assist】\nL70: \nL71: * * *\nL72: \nL73: * * *\nL74: \nL75: Properties\nL76: ### Quality Segment\nL77: \nL78: 【7†200】\nL79: \nL80: ### agency\nL81: \nL82: IP, according to USP\nL83: \nL84: ### sterility\nL85: \nL86: non-sterile\nL87: \nL88: ### form\nL89: \nL90: powder\nL91: \nL92: ### shelf life\nL93: \nL94: limited shelf life, expiry date on the label\nL95: \nL96: ### composition\nL97: \nL98: L-cystine, 0.5 g/L , dextrose, 5.5 g/L , pancreatic digest of casein, 15.0 g/L , sodium chloride, 2.5 g/L , sodium thioglycolate, 0.5 g/L , yeast extract, 5.0 g/L\nL99: \nL100: ### manufacturer/tradename\nL101: \nL102: NutriSelect^{®} Plus\nL103: \nL104: ### packaging\nL105: \nL106: pack of 100 g and 500 g\nL107: \nL108: ### final pH\nL109: \nL110: 7.1±0.2 (25 °C)\nL111: ### application(s)\nL112: \nL113: food and beverages\nL114: sterility testing, microbiology\nL115: \nL116: ### suitability\nL117: \nL118: anaerobic bacteria, bacteria (microaerophilic), nonselective for Aspergillus spp., nonselective for Bacillus spp., nonselective for Bacteroides spp., nonselective for Candida spp., nonselective for Clostridium spp., nonselective for Escherichia coli, nonselective for Pseudomonas spp., nonselective for Staphylococcus spp., nonselective for coliforms\nL119: \nL120: Description\nL121: ### Application\nL122: \nL123: A medium for sterility tests and the cultivation of microaerophilic and anaerobic organisms.\nL124: \nL125: ### Preparation Note\nL126: \nL127: Suspend 29 g in 1 litre of distilled water. Bring to the boil and dissolve the medium completely. Distribute into tubes or bottles and sterilize by autoclaving at 121°C for 15 minutes. Prepare freshly or boil and cool the medium just before use!\nL128: ### Other Notes\nL129: \nL130: We offer two media types: the superior granulated GranuCult^{®} and the cost-efficient powdered NutriSelect^{®} culture media, depending on your needs.\nL131: The designations basic, plus, or prime are added to indicate the quality control level, from basic quality control to standard QC plus to prime for full regulatory compliance.\nL132: \nL133: Sterility tests\nL134: ### Legal Information\nL135: \nL136: GRANUCULT is a registered trademark of Merck KGaA, Darmstadt, Germany\nL137: \nL138: NutriSelect is a registered trademark of Merck KGaA, Darmstadt, Germany\nL139: \nL140: * * *\nL141: \nL142: * * *\nL143: \nL144: ## Safety Information\nL145: \nL146: ### Pictograms\nL147: \nL148: 【8†GHS07】\nL149: \nL150: ### Signal Word\nL151: \nL152: Warning\nL153: \nL154: ### Hazard Codes\nL155: \nL156: 【9†H317】\nL157: \nL158: ### Precautionary Statements\nL159: \nL160: 【10†P261 - P272 - P280 - P302 + P352 - P333 + P313 - P362 + P364】\nL161: \nL162: ### Hazard Classifications\nL163: \nL164: Skin Sens. 1\nL165: \nL166: ### Storage Class\nL167: \nL168: 11 - Combustible Solids\nL169: ### PPE (personal protective equipment)\nL170: \nL171: Eyeshields, Gloves, type N95 (US)